# 基础词 Unit21
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023红宝书考研英语词汇-基础词
# 描述: 基础词Unit21核心词汇

{{fight}}{/faɪt/}}v. 战斗；n. 战斗；争吵}}{{They fought bravely to defend their homeland.}}
{{figure}}{/ˈfɪɡər/}}n. 数字；人物；身材；v. 计算}}{{The figure shows the growth trend over five years.}}
{{file}}{/faɪl/}}n. 文件；档案；v. 提交}}{{Please save the file to your desktop.}}
{{fill}}{/fɪl/}}v. 装满；填满}}{{She filled the glass with orange juice.}}
{{film}}{/fɪlm/}}n. 电影；胶片；v. 拍摄}}{{The film won several awards at the international festival.}}
{{final}}{/ˈfaɪnl/}}adj. 最终的；n. 决赛}}{{The final exam is scheduled for next Friday.}}
{{finance}}{/ˈfaɪnæns/}}n. 金融；v. 资助}}{{She studied finance at a top business school.}}
{{find}}{/faɪnd/}}v. 发现；找到}}{{I found my keys under the sofa.}}
{{fine}}{/faɪn/}}adj. 好的；罚款；n. 罚款}}{{He was fined for parking in the wrong place.}}
{{finger}}{/ˈfɪŋɡər/}}n. 手指}}{{She pointed her finger at the map to show the location.}}
{{finish}}{/ˈfɪnɪʃ/}}v. 完成；n. 结束}}{{I need to finish this report before the deadline.}}
{{fire}}{/ˈfaɪər/}}n. 火；火灾；v. 解雇；开火}}{{The fire spread quickly through the dry forest.}}
{{firm}}{/fɜːrm/}}adj. 坚定的；n. 公司}}{{The law firm has offices in several major cities.}}
{{fit}}{/fɪt/}}v. 适合；安装；adj. 健康的}}{{This dress fits you perfectly.}}
{{fix}}{/fɪks/}}v. 修理；固定}}{{The mechanic fixed the engine in just two hours.}}
{{flag}}{/flæɡ/}}n. 旗；旗帜}}{{The national flag was raised at the ceremony.}}
{{flame}}{/fleɪm/}}n. 火焰；热情}}{{The candle flame flickered in the breeze.}}
{{flash}}{/flæʃ/}}n. 闪光；v. 闪光；闪过}}{{A flash of lightning照亮了the night sky.}}
{{flat}}{/flæt/}}adj. 平坦的；n. 公寓}}{{The road is flat and easy to drive on.}}
{{flee}}{/fliː/}}v. 逃跑；逃离}}{{The refugees fled the war-torn country.}}
{{flexible}}{/ˈfleksəbl/}}adj. 灵活的；柔韧的}}{{We need a more flexible approach to solve this problem.}}
{{flight}}{/flaɪt/}}n. 航班；飞行}}{{The flight from Beijing to Shanghai takes about two hours.}}
{{float}}{/fləʊt/}}v. 漂浮；n. 浮子}}{{The boat floated gently on the calm lake.}}
{{flood}}{/flʌd/}}n. 洪水；v. 淹没}}{{The heavy rain caused a flood in the valley.}}
{{floor}}{/flɔːr/}}n. 地板；楼层}}{{The office is on the fifth floor of the building.}}
{{flow}}{/fləʊ/}}v. 流动；n. 流动}}{{The river flows through the heart of the city.}}
{{flower}}{/ˈflaʊər/}}n. 花；v. 开花}}{{The garden is full of colorful flowers in spring.}}
{{flu}}{/fluː/}}n. 流感}}{{She caught the flu and had to stay in bed for a week.}}
{{fly}}{/flaɪ/}}v. 飞；n. 苍蝇}}{{Birds fly south for the winter.}}
{{focus}}{/ˈfəʊkəs/}}n. 焦点；v. 集中}}{{You need to focus on your studies to pass the exam.}}
{{folk}}{/fəʊk/}}n. 人们；adj. 民间的}}{{Folk music is popular in many rural areas.}}
{{follow}}{/ˈfɒləʊ/}}v. 跟随；遵循}}{{Please follow the instructions carefully.}}
{{fond}}{/fɒnd/}}adj. 喜爱的；深情的}}{{She is very fond of reading mystery novels.}}
{{food}}{/fuːd/}}n. 食物；食品}}{{Chinese food is popular all over the world.}}
{{fool}}{/fuːl/}}n. 傻瓜；v. 愚弄}}{{Don't be fooled by his friendly appearance.}}
{{foot}}{/fʊt/}}n. 脚；英尺}}{{The mountain is over 5,000 feet high.}}
{{football}}{/ˈfʊtbɔːl/}}n. 足球；橄榄球}}{{Football is the most popular sport in many countries.}}
{{force}}{/fɔːrs/}}n. 力量；军队；v. 强迫}}{{The police used force to control the crowd.}}
{{foreign}}{/ˈfɒrən/}}adj. 外国的；外来的}}{{She is studying a foreign language at school.}}
{{forest}}{/ˈfɒrɪst/}}n. 森林}}{{The tropical forest is home to many rare species.}}
